       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LOOPDEMO.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-I            PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "07 - PERFORM VARYING LOOP"
           PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 10
               DISPLAY "COUNT = " WS-I
           END-PERFORM
           STOP RUN.